Package: cardiometR
Title: Cardiopulmonary Exercise Testing Analysis with S7 Classes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jonathan", "Tremblay", email = "jonathan.tremblay@umontreal.ca", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Import, analyze, and report cardiopulmonary exercise testing
    (CPET) data from COSMED Quark CPET metabolic carts. Provides S7 classes
    for type-safe physiological data structures, peak and ventilatory
    threshold detection following ATS/ACCP guidelines, test-quality
    assessment, an interactive Shiny application, and bilingual
    (English/French) PDF report generation via Typst.
